# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev`. .dev.vars is gitignored.
# Names only. Do not commit real values.
#
# Workers AI uses the AI binding. No model key goes here.
# Set these only when LLM_PROVIDER=ollama (local Node, or a Worker forced onto Ollama).
#
# OLLAMA_HOST=
# OLLAMA_API_KEY=
# CORS_ORIGIN=
